  "body_text": "它，可能是世界上单位密度里语言文明最多的国家\n它，可能是迄今为数不多的依旧有原始村落生态的国家\n它，也是生态多样性与咖啡品质可以与埃塞和肯尼亚媲美的产区\n它，就是我的心头好\n巴布亚新几内亚 Papua New Guinea\n感谢我们的好朋友Dion&Lisa\n2020产季，我们定向采购的第三个年头\n带着6款不同的单品\n它来了～\n它们是，四款Baroida庄园自己种植采收加工处理的单品\nBaroida Anaerobic Natural 首次日晒尝试\nBaroida Honey 首次蜜处理尝试\nBaroida Washed\nMorita Washed 单一地块，品种\n与两款，周边村落小农种植采收，由Baroida庄园采购进行加工处理的\nKobuta\n部落\n集体\nBoka 单一小农\n我们将它们放在一起，做了一款主题拼配\nPNG ALL IN ALL STAR\nBaroida Anaerobic Natural 25%\nBaroida Honey 15%\nBaroida Washed 15%\nBaroida Morita Washed 15%\nKobuta Washed 15%\nBoka Washed 15%\n它的风味是非常细腻柔和的柑橘复合莓果，想象一下一只不那么酸，但有着橘子，柚子明亮清甜的酸质，细腻，有层次，偶尔还会有热带水果的酵感。\n展会最后一天，我们会限量推出它\n有缘的话，来尝尝～\n这六款单品已经全部上架到小程序\n搜索 “巴布亚” 即可",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          它，可能是世界上单位密度里语言文明最多的国家\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          它，可能是迄今为数不多的依旧有原始村落生态的国家\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          它，也是生态多样性与咖啡品质可以与埃塞和肯尼亚媲美的产区\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          它，就是我的心头好\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          巴布亚新几内亚 Papua New Guinea\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          感谢我们的好朋友Dion&amp;Lisa\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          2020产季，我们定向采购的第三个年头\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          带着6款不同的单品\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          它来了～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          它们是，四款Baroida庄园自己种植采收加工处理的单品\n         </span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Baroida Anaerobic Natural 首次日晒尝试\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Baroida Honey 首次蜜处理尝试\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Baroida Washed\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Morita Washed 单一地块，品种\n            <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          与两款，周边村落小农种植采收，由Baroida庄园采购进行加工处理的\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Kobuta\n           </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            部落\n           </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            集体\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Boka 单一小农\n           </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          我们将它们放在一起，做了一款主题拼配\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n           PNG ALL IN ALL STAR\n          </strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Baroida Anaerobic Natural 25%\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Baroida Honey 15%\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Baroida Washed 15%\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Baroida Morita Washed 15%\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Kobuta Washed 15%\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Boka Washed 15%\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          它的风味是非常细腻柔和的柑橘复合莓果，想象一下一只不那么酸，但有着橘子，柚子明亮清甜的酸质，细腻，有层次，偶尔还会有热带水果的酵感。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          展会最后一天，我们会限量推出它\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          有缘的话，来尝尝～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这六款单品已经全部上架到小程序\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          搜索 “巴布亚” 即可\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q8gztY40VA89LGDdb23gg3bT3s8azp51FtLnHJWNg6Gn8Uw1Bib90OF2da4tHsJMYNEkul7icKibic0w/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;width: 253px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n</div>",
